---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import Base from "../layouts/base.astro";
import LandingBlock from "../components/landing_block.astro";
import Boxes from "../components/boxes.astro";
import Slides from "../components/slides.astro";
import { commonData } from "../components/common_data.astro";

import aniko2 from "../assets/images/photos/aniko-2.jpg";
import aniko3 from "../assets/images/photos/aniko-3.jpg";

    const metadata = {
    title: "Colour Analysis & Personal Styling | Glasgow",
    description: "Discover your colours, personal style and confidence with personalised colour analysis, colour interpretation and wardrobe styling in Glasgow. Start your journey to a wardrobe and style that truly feel like you.",
    type: "website",
};
---

<Base metadata={metadata}>
    <!-- <h1 class="py-4 md:py-6 font-lora text-xl md:text-4xl text-center">Colour. Self-discovery. Style.</h1> -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
        <LandingBlock title="Discover what suits you – inside and out.">
            <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">The way we dress is about so much more than clothes.</p>
            <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">It can influence how we feel, how we see ourselves and how confidently we move through the world.</p>
            <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Through personalised colour analysis, colour interpretation and wardrobe styling, I help you understand what
                truly works for you – so you can make choices that feel natural, confident and authentically yours.</p>
            <p><strong>Discover your colours. Understand yourself. Create a wardrobe that feels like you.</strong></p>
            <div class="flex flex-row justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
                <a href={commonData.links.book15mins} class="mt-6 px-4 py-4 mx-2 bg-bittersweet hover:bg-coral-pink text-white">Book a free 15-minute consultation</a>
            </div>
        </LandingBlock>
        <Image class="min-h-full md:max-h-[700px] object-cover justify-self-center" src={aniko2} alt="" />
    </div>
    <LandingBlock title="Your style journey starts with understanding yourself" bgClass="bg-pic-pantone">
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">There is no one-size-fits-all approach to style.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Your colouring, personality, lifestyle, body shape and the way you want to feel all play a part in how you present yourself.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">My approach combines practical styling knowledge with self-discovery, giving you the tools to make more confident choices for
            yourself – rather than simply following a set of rules.</p>
        <p>Whether you want to discover your best colours, explore the deeper meaning of your colour choices, or finally make sense of
            the wardrobe you already own, we can start where you are.</p>
    </LandingBlock>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
        <LandingBlock title="Find the service that feels right for you">
            <Slides id="services-slide">
                <div class="min-w-full w-full justify-items-center flex flex-col justify-center">
                    <h4 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Colour Analysis</h4>
                    <h5 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Discover the colours that bring you to life.</h5>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Find the shades that harmonise with your natural colouring and learn how to use them in clothing, accessories and makeup.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">You will leave with a better understanding of your colour palette and practical knowledge that makes everyday choices easier.</p>
                    <p><strong>2-3 hours · {commonData.prices.colourAnalysis}</strong></p>
                    <div class="flex flex-row justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
                        <a href={commonData.links.colourAnalysis} class="mt-6 px-4 py-4 mx-2 bg-bittersweet hover:bg-coral-pink text-white">Explore Colour Analysis</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="min-w-full w-full justify-items-center flex flex-col justify-center">
                    <h4 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Colour Interpretation</h4>
                    <h5 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">What might your colour choices be saying about you?</h5>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Colour can affect how we feel, what we express and how we connect with ourselves.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Colour Interpretation uses the psychological effects and symbolism of colour as a tool for self-reflection and personal awareness.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">It is a space to pause, explore and gain a different perspective on yourself and the phase of life you are currently in.</p>
                    <p><strong>90 minutes · {commonData.prices.colourInterpretation}</strong></p>
                    <div class="flex flex-row justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
                        <a href={commonData.links.colourInterpretation} class="mt-6 px-4 py-4 mx-2 bg-bittersweet hover:bg-coral-pink text-white">Explore Colour Interpretation</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="min-w-full w-full justify-items-center flex flex-col justify-center">
                    <h4 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Wardrobe Edit</h4>
                    <h5 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Make your wardrobe work for you.</h5>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Do you have plenty of clothes but still feel like you have nothing to wear?</p>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Together, we can declutter what no longer serves you, rediscover the pieces you already own and create outfits that work for your lifestyle, body shape and personality.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">The aim is not to buy more.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">It is to help you understand what you already have – and use it with confidence.</p>
                    <p><strong>3-4 hours · {commonData.prices.wardrobeEdit}</strong></p>
                    <div class="flex flex-row justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
                        <a href={commonData.links.wardrobeEdit} class="mt-6 px-4 py-4 mx-2 bg-bittersweet hover:bg-coral-pink text-white">Explore Wardrobe Edit</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </Slides>
        </LandingBlock>
        <Image class="min-h-full md:max-h-[750px] object-cover justify-self-center md:order-first" src={aniko3} alt="" />
    </div>
    <LandingBlock title="One journey – three different starting points" bgClass="bg-pic-shop">
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">You do not need to do everything.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">You can choose the service that answers the question you are asking yourself right now.</p>
        <h4 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">“Which colours actually suit me?”</h4>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Start with <strong>Colour Analysis</strong>.</p>
        <h4 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">“Why am I drawn to certain colours, and what can I learn from that?”</h4>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Start with <strong>Colour Interpretation</strong>.</p>
        <h4 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">“Why is getting dressed so difficult when I have so many clothes?”</h4>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Start with <strong>Wardrobe Edit</strong>.</p>
        <p>And if you want to explore both your outer appearance and your inner world through colour, you can combine
            Colour Analysis and Colour Interpretation in my <strong>Rainbow Package</strong>.</p>
    </LandingBlock>
    <LandingBlock title="Your colours are only the beginning">
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Knowing which colours suit you is a powerful starting point.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">But what happens when you bring that knowledge into your everyday wardrobe?</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">That is where colour, style and practicality come together.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Your wardrobe does not need to be bigger. It needs to work better for you.</p>
        <p>A Wardrobe Edit helps you turn knowledge into everyday choices – creating combinations from the clothes you
            already own and identifying only the pieces that genuinely add value.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-row justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8">
            <a href={commonData.links.wardrobeEdit} class="mt-6 px-4 py-4 mx-2 bg-bittersweet hover:bg-coral-pink text-white">Explore Wardrobe Edit</a>
        </div>
    </LandingBlock>
    <LandingBlock title="Why work with me?" bgClass="bg-pic-street">
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">I do not believe style is about becoming someone else.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">It is about understanding yourself better and learning how to express that through what you wear.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">My approach is personal, supportive and practical.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">I will not simply tell you what you should wear. I will give you the knowledge and confidence to understand
            why something works for you – so that eventually, you can make those decisions for yourself.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Because the ultimate goal is not to create a wardrobe that looks good for one consultation.</p>
        <p>It is to help you feel good in your clothes long afterwards.</p>
    </LandingBlock>
    <LandingBlock title="What can change when you understand your style?">
        <Boxes items={[
            { title: 'Confidence', text: 'Feel more comfortable and assured in the clothes you choose.'},
            { title: 'Clarity', text: 'Stop second-guessing every colour, outfit or purchase.'},
            { title: 'Self-expression', text: 'Use your appearance to reflect who you are and how you want to feel.'},
            { title: 'Mindful choices', text: 'Shop with greater intention and make better use of what you already own.'},
            { title: 'Ease', text: 'Make getting dressed simpler, more enjoyable and less overwhelming.'},
            { title: 'Positive Feedback', text: 'Harmonious style attract compliments and positive recognition from others.' },
        ]}/>
    </LandingBlock>

    <!-- ADD SAMPLE TESTIMONIALS HERE? -->

    <LandingBlock title="Ready to start your journey?" bgClass="bg-pic-dressing-room">
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">You do not need to know exactly which service you need.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">That is what the free consultation is for.</p>
        <p class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Book a <strong>15-minute consultation</strong> and tell me what you would like to change, what currently feels difficult and
            what you would love to get out of the process.</p>
        <p>We will talk through your options and find the most suitable place to begin.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-row justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8 mb-3 md:mb-6">
            <a href={commonData.links.book15mins} class="mt-6 px-4 py-4 mx-2 bg-bittersweet hover:bg-coral-pink text-white">Book a free 15-minute consultation</a>
        </div>
        <h4 class="mb-3 md:mb-6">Colour. Self-discovery. Style.</h4>
        <p><strong>Discover what works for you.<br/>
            Learn how to use it.<br/>
            Wear it with confidence.</strong></p>
    </LandingBlock>
</Base>
